        "slug": "sahra-coffee",
        "title": {
          "en": "Sahra Coffee rebrand",
          "ar": "إعادة تصميم هوية قهوة صحرا"
        },
        "type": "standard",
        "sections": [
          {
            "id": "aurora-case",
            "blockType": "caseStudy",
            "variant": "problem-process-result",
            "content": {
              "eyebrow": {
                "en": "Case study",
                "ar": "دراسة حالة"
              },
              "title": {
                "en": "Sahra Coffee: one identity for twelve cafés",
                "ar": "قهوة صحرا: هوية واحدة لاثني عشر مقهى"
              },
              "subtitle": {
                "en": "A warmer brand, new packaging and a menu system for a Doha roastery that was growing faster than its look.",
                "ar": "علامة أكثر دفئًا وتغليف جديد ونظام قوائم لمحمصة في الدوحة كانت تكبر أسرع من مظهرها."
              },
              "cover": {
                "url": "/stock/photo/vr-hex.jpg",
                "width": 498,
                "height": 332,
                "alt": {
